    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Students are required to uphold the fundamental principles of academic integrity, place a strong emphasis on academic ethics, and take active measures to prevent instances of cheating or plagiarism.</div>\n\n<div>In the event that a student is found to have engaged in cheating or plagiarism, the consequences are serious. Examinations and final reports that involve such misconduct will be assigned a grade of zero.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
